0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0199,"r5":0.0037,"r1_spy":0.0242,"r5_spy":0.0128}}],"quotes":[{"c":"SWX 2019 Q2","e":"swx","d":"2019-08-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gregory J. Peterson","x":"I think it's just a general overall view of keeping costs from rising quickly always, want to caveat that we're not trying to do cost reduction measures, but cost containment measures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q2-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SWX 2019 Q2","e":"swx","d":"2019-08-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Ryan Levine","x":"Hey, what was the amount of the pension and medical cost reduction during the quarter?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q2-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SWX 2019 Q4","e":"swx","d":"2020-02-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Justin Brown","x":"Some other recent developments included proposal in California to amend our tariff to facilitate renewable natural gas purchases and include them in our gas portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q4-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SWX 2020 Q1","e":"swx","d":"2020-05-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Justin L. Brown","x":"Some other recent developments include our proposal in California to amend our tariff to facilitate renewable natural gas purchases and to be able to include them in our gas portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SWX 2020 Q1","e":"swx","d":"2020-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gregory J. Peterson","x":"So some of those, I guess, in summary, some of those cost savings will carry over into the future, but some will return to more normal levels as the economy normalizes again.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SWX 2020 Q1","e":"swx","d":"2020-05-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Gregory J. Peterson","x":"We've taken that into account and setting the guidance and reaffirming the guidance of $3.75 to $4. and we're looking at other measures to make sure we keep in that range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SWX 2020 Q3","e":"swx","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gregory J. Peterson","x":"Over 80% of our office staff works from home and there have been some cost savings associated with that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SWX 2020 Q3","e":"swx","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gregory J. Peterson","x":"That has been limited at the time and that has been cost savings to us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SWX 2020 Q4","e":"swx","d":"2021-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John P. Hester","x":"We now have tariffs and programs throughout our service territories to support expanded deployment of RNG and CNG to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SWX 2020 Q4","e":"swx","d":"2021-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Justin L. Brown","x":"We've got some good tariffs in California and Arizona.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SWX 2020 Q4","e":"swx","d":"2021-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gregory J. Peterson","x":"A modified process to minimize customer contact during tenant changes saved about $2 million in expenses and we temporarily reduced headcount by about 1% from 2019 levels, while maintaining a 96% customer satisfaction rating.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SWX 2021 Q1","e":"swx","d":"2021-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John P. Hester","x":"Service territory expansions in Mesquite and Spring Creek will not only provide convenience in energy cost savings to our new customers, but will allow them to reduce their community's carbon footprint as they move toward natural gas usage and away from more carbon intense energy alternatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SWX 2021 Q2","e":"swx","d":"2021-08-06","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"John P. Hester","x":"They have been having a number of events actually on simultaneous days Allegiant Stadium, T-Mobile and the Park Theater.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SWX 2021 Q3","e":"swx","d":"2021-11-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Justin Brown","x":"…much focused on as we're putting the filing together to make sure that we emphasize the various cost savings, cost management initiatives that have been going on that contribute to managing the reasonable level of our bills because we recognize that given the capital investments that that's…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/southwest-gas-holdings-inc-swx-q3-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SWX 2025 Q3","e":"swx","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Justin Lee Brown","x":"The Public Utilities Commission of Nevada has begun rulemaking workshops to implement SB 417, and we're excited about the potential for this approach to streamline regulatory processes, reduce costs, and improve the timeliness of cost recovery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/southwest-gas-swx-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SWX 2025 Q3","e":"swx","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Justin Lee Brown","x":"This new approach could streamline the regulatory process, reduce costs, and improve the timeliness of cost recovery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/southwest-gas-swx-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SWX 2025 Q4","e":"swx","d":"2026-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Justin Brown","x":"The FERC also encouraged evaluation of potential eligibility under Title 41 of the FAST Act, which is designed to streamline federal permitting through enhanced interagency coordination.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/southwest-gas-swx-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SWX 2026 Q2","e":"swx","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Justin Brown","x":"I think we always -- every time in each of our cases, we really focus on working collaboratively with the staff and the stakeholders to try to find opportunities to streamline the case where we can reach agreement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/southwest-gas-swx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SWX 2026 Q2","e":"swx","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Justin Brown","x":"As we get close to getting their testimony at the end of the month, we will then look to work with the parties on areas of common ground and try to streamline the case, and we'll see how it goes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/southwest-gas-swx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SWX 2026 Q2","e":"swx","d":"2026-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Justin Forsberg","x":"We are reaffirming our 2026 guidance metrics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/southwest-gas-swx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SWX 2026 Q3","e":"swx","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"manage